      "description": "Batman (1966): One of the show's many rogues and the very first villain to be introduced. He was portrayed byFrank Gorshinin the first and third season of the series, as well as theBatman: The Moviefilm, whileJohn Astinportrayed him in the show's second season.Click hereto see his character page. Batman Forever: Riddler was one of theBig Badsof the film. He is portrayed byJim Carrey.Click hereto see his character page. Gotham: Edward Nygma was one of the supporting characters and a forensic scientist working for the GCPD before he eventually turned to crime and embraced the criminal persona of the Riddler. He is portrayed byCory Michael Smith.Click hereto see his character page. The Batman (2022): The Riddler is theBig Badof the film. He is portrayed byPaul Dano.Click hereto see his character page. The Batman (2004): Riddler was one of the villains of the show, sporting a more goth-like appearance. He is voiced byRobert Englund.Click hereto see his character page.",
